{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "a284774c0d99e6e439456df2e37672b381fe53b7dfd380d1632705c77a60f40c", "ja": "お姫様たちのお茶会", "zh": "公主们的茶会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0dc3b0c79e4edeb97413ad9f63be964bcb94d623b1cb73ed1f6b86e733d28d9c", "ja": "雑誌の撮影企画で『お姫様たちのお茶会』を\nする事になったまつりとエミリー。カップや\nメニューにこだわるエミリーに、直感で決め\nるのがお姫様だと言うまつり。準備はばっち\nり、ぱーふぇくと！なお茶会が始まった。", "zh": "在杂志拍摄企划中，决定举办一场“公主们的茶会”，于是小祭和艾米莉一起准备了起来。艾米莉对茶杯和菜单都很讲究，而小祭则说，凭直觉做决定才是公主。准备工作万无一失，完美无缺的茶会开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "5dd10406507f896eae6bbbb990a6a723b0059bc485e2e85897fcdc3a6468b2af", "ja": "まあっ……！　なんて素敵なお店なのでしょう。\n今日は、ここでお茶をいただけるのですか？", "zh": "哇……！多么棒的店啊。今天要在这里品茶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9bfad74c67154c5298aa79a848fb764674607be586dadb238233be6296dba93", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、それだけではないのです。\n今回はこのお店のアフタヌーンティーセットで……。", "zh": "艾米莉，这还不止这些。\n这次要用这家店的下午茶套餐来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b9de05e3fb0a6b55db36f47389a5be161680d316761012a88260a4bd8873db7", "ja": "『お姫様たちのお茶会』の撮影をするのです～！\n姫たちに、ぴったりな企画なのです～！", "zh": "要拍摄《公主们的茶会》啦～！\n这是非常适合公主们的企划哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "456d56f75d4b166c08340ab4c8a01456f27298cb763be108b972abf2604bdd5a", "ja": "お姫さまらしく、気合いを入れていくのです♪", "zh": "要像公主一样，打起精神来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "b5d838b0025aa43043d65915406ac394e0138d957276c9077e488a7a7a9b2e26", "ja": "はいっ、まつりさん！\n姫君らしく、気合いを入れて……ですね！", "zh": "好的，まつり小姐！\n要像公主一样鼓足干劲……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "771d2710d7c99a550ec2990330d6d786b0d39feaeda3e30cabf0eb0d8d1c9d63", "ja": "姫君として相応しい立ち居振る舞いができるよう、\nがんばらないと……！", "zh": "为了展现出符合公主身份的仪态举止，\n我得好好努力才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "186712d5b204e6e981179e09cf6cb990f9374bdcd591bcf343cda2758cbb8a34", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、何も心配することはないのです。\nエミリーちゃんは、立派なお姫さまなのですから。", "zh": "小艾米莉，没什么好担心的哦。因为小艾米莉本来就是一位出色的公主呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "51fbf4bbf018011c49117c28178190fe657b0fde915da1509f63fb5c1181e896", "ja": "まつりさん、ありがとうございます！\nそう言っていただけて、ほっとしました。", "zh": "玛茨莉，谢谢您！\n听您这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "90cec1cb91dc9f06a1fb565537274349c28c4484b8f5ccfb6380346c878a4913", "ja": "ふふっ、とってもかわいい笑顔なのです。\nやっぱりエミリーちゃんは、プリンセスなのです！", "zh": "呵呵，好可爱的笑容呀。\n果然，艾米莉是公主呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8baff571bd0d6e5387e9d32cf227892765214722419a7304fc34e2e289b29e1", "ja": "では、お茶会の準備を始めるのです！\nまずは、ティーカップを選ぶのです。", "zh": "那么，就开始准备茶会吧！\n首先来挑选茶杯吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "b405d500bd583f01b3278a093e5de3856f7ca3f179da87f504225f4d7924bc1e", "ja": "はい♪　こちらのお店は、茶器にも\nこだわりを持たれているのでしたね。", "zh": "是的♪　这家店对茶具也很讲究呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "09d276321c2aaa5df28e3a2a1751964d47cbe66c9e144f29ac03dac9c1725e83", "ja": "いろんなティーカップが並んでいるのです。\nエミリーちゃんは、好みのものはあるのです？", "zh": "摆着各种各样的茶杯呢。\n艾米莉有喜欢的款式吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "4a9d7ff0e6b6554ac9323a94ca6336ce5ed00a35cf59bfe58d13184e62639f56", "ja": "そうですね……あっ！　私はこちらの、\n野ばらの柄の器が好きです。とても愛らしいです♪", "zh": "是呢……啊！我喜欢这只印有野蔷薇图案的茶杯。非常可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d8d2ef494d24ff3dc0188c0e642ebebcca7e6581badb37c55fbf1c5d3b3e505", "ja": "そーきゅーと！なのです～。\nプリンセスにぴったりのティーカップなのです！", "zh": "好可爱呀～！\n是非常适合公主的茶杯呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "af35363c6722bafcecc5c89221754063f777618958a801723fc08bdbf244eabb", "ja": "姫も、これが気に入ったのです。\n撮影は、このカップを使いましょー！", "zh": "公主也很中意这个呢。\n拍摄就用这个茶杯吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "4b553deab706c2ec7aa1345605ccb5980a748608c83f7e996b14298639a18928", "ja": "まぁ。まつりさん、いいのですか？\n私が選んでしまったもので。", "zh": "哎呀。茉莉小姐，这样可以吗？\n毕竟是我挑中的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "76c80047c0f061c855c3248df240bfc77c9a27336582319402f996ef0cc0eb22", "ja": "もちろんなのです。このティーカップでお茶をすれば、\nとびきり・わんだほー！な気持ちになれるのですよ。", "zh": "当然可以啦。用这个茶杯喝茶的话，\n心情就会变得超级・奇妙～！呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "c5ef6abfaf980c1808f9866cbe8f4cb5017652260da7b4b85ded77f0429b3531", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね！　私も、\n素晴らしい気持ちになれると思います♪", "zh": "呵呵，说得没错！我也觉得一定能拥有无比美好的心情♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "f7c5e9de15a26b23d290724f7def9f3cd5109c6b0119b2203f7903024f5a4bd2", "ja": "器も決まったところで……\n次は、お品書きを見ておかなければですね。", "zh": "茶具也定下来了……\n接下来，得看看菜单才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "5d0ddc9f626f5d0c0a03661c3d965189c83f21668cdde77b64e14e80bc726a59", "ja": "サンドイッチ、スコーン、ケーキ……\nどれもお姫さまに相応しい食べ物なのです♪", "zh": "三明治、司康、蛋糕……\n每一样都是适合公主的食物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b69521f46223a088c6e893546d65f5409c1ff41a97e73d558414a63c70b4515", "ja": "あ、食べる順番はいかがいたしましょう？\n姫君らしくいただくとなると、ええと……。", "zh": "啊，您觉得该按什么顺序享用才好呢？要像公主殿下那样享用的话，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "357e1697ded012e3ab72e52334489c0d21bba208ae1e7f10da0095fac8ea4296", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、迷った時は……直感で決めるのです！", "zh": "艾米莉，犹豫不决的时候……就凭直觉决定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "bf1a828fa461ad27448b6fa14839921ed2c8e7bc02428bca1afb90a8903aa267", "ja": "ええっ？\nまつりさん、それでいいのですか？", "zh": "诶？\n小公主，这样真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "b53203914e78239cc112f3f61088e6a69787069bb076e3e0954467b2ead7ef43", "ja": "お姫さまは、自分の気持ちに素直なのです。その時\n一番食べたいものに手を伸ばすのが、正解なのです！", "zh": "公主殿下要忠于自己的心情。此时此刻，伸手去拿最想吃的东西，就是正确答案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "30e43fa953ff45021c66f1ad90885c738fad8f8bfed2b185ebd00ada58a1f96b", "ja": "なるほど……わかりました！\nでは本番でも、直感で、ですね！", "zh": "原来如此……明白了！\n那么正式演出时，也要凭直觉，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "d85b60432600aba649441bbd9c4c1fdae6f3cbece9b3f892d943540d5745cf29", "ja": "はいほー！　これで準備は、ばっちりなのです。\nぱーふぇくと！に楽しみましょー！", "zh": "嗨哟——！这样一来，准备工作就万无一失了哦。\n完美！让我们尽情享受吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_009_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_009_cc_01_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "8a9c0d75597c857c243dc1fa752ef78a7673f639a1a96194bf9e80ae315d619b", "ja": "はいっ！　素敵な姫君のお茶会が、\nお届けできそうですね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "没问题！这下应该能为美丽的公主殿下举办茶会了。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
